em components like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOListItem"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This provider should be integrated as a ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllListItemComponentTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"code":"MISOTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It implements also the protocol ","type":"text"},{"code":"ListItemComponentTokens","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" so as to expose the component tokens for list item components through any ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Such component tokens are defined with raw and semantic tokens of sizes (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"borders (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), colors (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"spaces (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), opacities (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllOpacitySemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and dimensions (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllDimensionSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],